CHA01018        3-Letter-Code for Satellte: CHA; Day-of-Year: 116; starts at 13:xx UTC
Champ 		Full Name of Satellite (10 Chars)
gfz6153         CPF Source: GFZ; Set Number: 6153: 615 minus 500 = Day-of-Year 115; Version 3
   8002         SAT Number
0003902         COSPAR SAT Number
85 35.4         Az/El at Closest Approach
   2007         Year of Pass Start
    116         Day-Of-Year of Pass Start
 135744         Hour-Minute-Second of Pass Start
      4         Time interval [secs] of following track lines
    110         Number of following track lines
  0   0         JXP,JYP (Polar Motion Values); historical ....
  1  -1         Visibility conditions: 
                1: Visible at begin (0: Invisible); 
               -1: No change during pass;or 
	    78234: Change at this epoch [Seconds of Day]
